# Interfaces & code budgets

## Conditioning vector (~12 numbers, workspace-normalized)
| Field | Dim | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `p_hat(t+Δ)` | 3 | Predicted object pos at action-landing time |
| `v_hat` | 3 | Filtered velocity |
| `delta` | 1 | Lookahead used (train delay-agnostic) |
| `sigma_p` | 1–3 | Position uncertainty |
| `valid / coast_time` | 1 | Track live vs coasting |
| optional intercept | 3 | Hand–object meeting point |

Oracle and filter **must** emit the same schema. Swapping them is a config flag, not a rewrite.

## Budgets (glue, not frameworks)
| Module | Budget |
|---|---|
| Detector glue | ~50 |
| Tracker | ~100 |
| 3D lift | ~80 |
| Kalman filter | ~200 |
| Policy state append | ~50 |
| Executor buffer | ~150 |
| Reflex | ~150 |

If you need more lines, you are probably solving the wrong problem — re-read Section 10 of `foresight_plan.md`.
